obs Five graded artifacts stand at B or better: the harness A+ at 100, the paper A at 94, the card A+ at 100, the witness B+ at 86, the control B at 81. All cited paths resolve. tame_style_check and width-check both read GREEN after the harness landed.
obs The card sat 221 bytes under its 40960 ceiling when this lap opened, so the new account was cut to fit rather than the bound raised. It closes at 40952.
obs The cold open refused with run_verdict=tree_moved, and the refusal is mine: the card says hold still while the pass runs, and this lap wrote the harness while it was running. Its readings were 211 guards with zero red, describing neither tree. The hot pass over the staged tree is the receipt that stands.
loom roster_hot guards_run=212 guards_green=210 guards_red=0 guards_gated=2 skipped_capability=2 guards_seconds=2339 tree_moved=no query_wire_retention=green
recommend keep-going Bakery can point the harness at the run_client_query review for a number in one sitting; the answer-size distribution wants counting before anyone reshapes QueryWireResponse.
scope Retained-answer cost measurement, its harness, its control, its witness, and this record
status GREEN -- full staged hot roster 212 guards, 210 green, zero red, two custody gates (%5), tree held still, the new guard green in 1s; harness reads tier=counters on this host; control passes five checks with the plant collapsing 60009 to 6; witness GREEN; tame_style_check and width-check GREEN; five artifacts grade B or better. Hot roster and both pushes follow this written verdict.
